WEBVTT

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.001
is the lack of community.

00:16:30.025 --> 00:16:34.532
So I've really come to admire people
I call "weavers," who live for community.

00:16:34.556 --> 00:16:37.020
They live for relationship,
not for themselves.

00:16:37.044 --> 00:16:40.895
And there are so many people like that.
There are weavers all around the country.

00:16:40.919 --> 00:16:43.436
They're a movement that
doesn't know it's a movement.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.876
I find them inspiring
because social change happens

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.504
when a small group of people
find a better way to live,

00:16:48.528 --> 00:16:50.099
and the rest of us copy them.

00:16:50.123 --> 00:16:52.329
These weavers have found
a better way to live.

00:16:52.353 --> 00:16:54.466
And sometimes they have very bad valleys.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.790
A woman I met in Ohio named Sarah,

00:16:56.814 --> 00:17:00.042
her husband murdered
their kids and himself.